# R Capstone

Analysis of poverty and test performance in New York public schools.

## Files

- `analysis.Rmd` — main analysis, knit to `analysis.html`
- `scripts/` — pipeline scripts (`1_clean.R`, `2_transform.R`, `3_analyze.R`, `4_plot.R`)
- `run_all.R` — runs the full pipeline
- `data/processed/nys_acs_school_final.csv` — merged dataset
- `plots/` — output charts

## Run

Open the project in RStudio, then knit `analysis.Rmd` or `source("run_all.R")`.
